  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The wave generators at points A and B create waves that have a wavelength of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span> cm. When only one of the generators is operating, the amplitude of the generated wave at point C is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span> cm.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the amplitude of the resulting wave at point C when the two generators operate in phase?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span> cm</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span> cm</li>\n</ol>"
